e concession is not available in summer semester. [undergraduate-academic-rules-aug-2023.pdf / 6. Rules for Summer Semester]\nA minimum of TEN (10) students should register in a summer course. [undergraduate-academic-rules-aug-2023.pdf / 6. Rules for Summer Semester]\nWarning Count is incremented/decremented in summer semester. [undergraduate-academic-rules-aug-2023.pdf / 6. Rules for Summer Semester]",
